 29	 * questionnaire, TTL-bounded, and swept on an OTHER user's login, on
 30	 * signOut and on app update — every eviction hook is deliberate; a new
 31	 * session boundary must join the sweep list. Expired drafts are swept at
 32	 * boot regardless of auth outcome. A user's OWN drafts deliberately
 33	 * survive their own re-login — that is the crash/session-expiry recovery
 34	 * this layer exists for, not a bug (see `fillDraftCache.ts`).
 35	 *
 36	 * One key holds the WHOLE fill session: the route-mounted questionnaire
 37	 * plus every questionnaire added to the same submission.
 38	 */
 39	export type { FillDraftScope } from "./fillDraftCore";
